=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  logforward refuse-twice --------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Decided: no Figma frame. Set servers with one address and port$
# twice in hardn.yml: the whole list is refused, saying which$
# entry.$
$
  Checking the host...$
$
# Warning$
# hardn.yml's syslogServers is not valid: server 2: the same$
# address and port as server 1. Fix that, then try again.$
$
# Syslog Settings ##############################################$
$
  [ ] Syslog               Review ~ not forwarding$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Logger               rsyslog$
   -  Server               None$
  [ ] hardn.yml            Not valid$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set servers          hardn.yml is not valid$
   2) Refresh              Read the host again$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-2 or q]: $
$
$

